# Native WebView

Sources: `packages/web/src/shared/lib/webview.ts`, `webview-trust.lib.ts`, `webview-incoming-message.lib.ts`, `webview-native-message.lib.ts`, and `packages/web/src/app/webview-shell.tsx`.

- Inspect current handlers before documenting native capabilities or credentials. Legacy bridge payloads are not a Workspace authentication contract.
- Preserve source/origin trust checks and payload validation. Do not turn an unknown origin into trusted input to make a native example work.
- Never transport credentials in navigation URLs, query strings, analytics, or logs.
- Add a shell route/registry entry only when the requested native integration needs it. A normal page does not automatically require a WebView integration.
- Preserve close/back/navigation semantics and safe-area behavior; verify the intended native bridge separately from ordinary browser tests.
